“You know you’re a knockout,” he said dismissively, but when he
noticed the strange look on her face, he raised a brow. “What?”
“You’re sweet.”
He cocked his head to the side. “You don’t think you’re a knockout?”
She let out a strained laugh. “You’ve met my sisters, right?”
